---
import Callout from "../../components/Callout.astro";
import CodeBlock from "../../components/CodeBlock.astro";
import Terminal from "../../components/Terminal.astro";
import Post from "../../layouts/Post.astro";
---

<Post slug="wispctl-1-3-2">
	<p>
		wispctl 1.3.2 is a very minor update that updates the oauth to use
		permission sets to make the oauth links 79% smaller.
	</p>

	<figure>
		<img src="/images/oauth.png" />
	</figure>

	<p>
		another bonus is that the consent screen better explains what the cli is
		requesting out of your account
	</p>

	<figure>
		<img
			src="/images/consent-screen.png"
			alt="a wispctl consent screen asking for Manage your wisp.place sites
			Create, update, and delete your site files and settings. and Use wisp.place hosting features
			Manage your sites, custom domains, and private site links."
		/>
	</figure>

	<h2>upgrading</h2>

	<CodeBlock lang="bash" code="npm install -g wispctl@1.3.2" />
</Post>
